    "body": "**Problem:** The mempool memory estimate omits the txid set used to retry the initial broadcast of locally submitted transactions, so `getmempoolinfo` and `-maxmempool` undercount retained memory.\r\n\r\n**Fix:** Count this set when calculating mempool memory usage.\r\n",
